WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.300
Ken’s counter Drive Impact crumples Ryu.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.450
Jump heavy kick connects during the crumple conversion.

3
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.950
The heavy OD Jinrai continuation keeps Ryu airborne.

4
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.750
Ken finishes through Quick Dash into Shoryuken.

5
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.600
Ryu falls after the OD conversion.
